   "text": "SABIHA GOKCEN AD,\nRWY 06L/24R SHALL BE TEMPORARILY CLSD TO DEP AND ARR TFC DUE TO \nRWY MAINTENANCE AS FOLLOWING DATES AND TIMES:\n\n1- BTN 29 MAR 2026, 2300 UTC-10 MAY 2026, 0159 UTC:\n\nMON: 0000-0159 UTC, 2150-2359 UTC,\nTUE: 0000-0249 UTC, 2150-2359 UTC,\nWED: 0000-0249 UTC, 2150-2359 UTC,\nTHU: 0000-0249 UTC, 2300-2359 UTC,\nFRI: 0000-0159 UTC, 2300-2359 UTC,\nSAT: 0000-0159 UTC, 2300-2359 UTC,\nSUN: 0000-0159 UTC, 2300-2359 UTC,\n\n2- BTN 10 MAY 2026, 2300 UTC-24 OCT 2026, 0159 UTC:\n\nMON: 0000-0159 UTC, 2300-2359 UTC,\nTUE: 0000-0159 UTC, 2300-2359 UTC,\nWED: 0000-0159 UTC, 2300-2359 UTC,\nTHU: 0000-0159 UTC, 2300-2359 UTC,\nFRI: 0000-0159 UTC, 2300-2359 UTC,\nSAT: 0000-0159 UTC, 2300-2359 UTC,\nSUN: 0000-0159 UTC, 2300-2359 UTC,\n\n\n3- PILOTS OF DEP TFC SHALL REQUEST START UP AND PUSH-BACK CLEARANCE \nBEFORE 25 MINUTES FROM RWY CLOSURE TIME NOT REGARDING SLOT TIME.",
   "reading_short": "Runway 06L/24R is temporarily closed for maintenance.",
